" kill-switch and per-connection scopes, an exportable audit trail of every "
"AI call, automatic data privacy masking (even in exports), per-user "
"allow/deny policies with a dry-run simulator, human approval for risky "
"writes, and an outbound guard so the AI never emails anyone on its own. One-"
"time purchase, no subscription."
